the second summer update for animal  crossing is coming this week an  injustice 3 announcement may be being  teased and cuphead comes to ps4  hey guys it's been a while i'm chasity  and you've reached your safe safer  tuesday july 28th  dust off your animal crossing islands  because the second summer update is  coming on thursday and it comes with  fireworks  dreams and even backup saves i haven't  played in so long that i bet my  villagers are extremely mad at me  new horizons second summer update is  releasing on july 30th and it's adding a  few new features  one of these is the island backup  restoration service it's only available  to nintendo switch online members  the service is for backup saves but it  doesn't work the same way as typical  cloud saves on the switch  you don't need to manually back anything  up your island and villagers will  periodically update on nintendo's  servers  this way you can get your island back if  your switch is broken or stolen  nintendo also says you'll be able to  transfer your island to another switch  in a future update  the update also adds firework shows  they'll happen every sunday at 7 pm in  august  and new crafting tools will let you make  custom fireworks designs  lastly the update brings back luna when  you sleep luna can take you to dream  versions of other players islands  this will let you change things on the  island in the dream without actually  changing anything permanently on the  real island and your island will get a  dream address to share with friends  another new horizons update is coming  this fall so i'll definitely give my  friends my dream address but you guys  could also just come over and make the  island better because i just kind of  gave up on it  so a comic writer has been teasing the  return of the injustice comics but are  we also getting an injustice 3  announcement soon  injustice 3 hasn't been officially  announced but comic book writer tom  taylor has been teasing the return of  the injustice comic series on twitter he  posted the letters i and  n in the injustice font with quotes from  the first two series  so it really seems like he's teasing a  third one and just today he also tweeted  an image of the letter z  but it could also be an n turned on its  side in justice  what do you know what aren't you telling  us the previous comic series has served  as prequels to the events of the  injustice games a third series means we  could hear about a third game  unless dc decided to spin off the comics  from the games developer netherrealm has  been alternating between injustice and  mortal kombat games in the past few  years  injustice 2 was 2017 mortal kombat 11  was 2019  leaving a possible 2021 slot open for  injustice 3.  warner brothers will have announcements  at the dc fandom event on august 22nd so  we may hear more there  and finally surprise cuphead is out  today on ps4  i can't wait to get frustrated all over  again with how bad i am at that game  great game though cuphead has been  playable on pc xbox one switch and even  tesla vehicles but now ps4 players can  finally play  you can grab it for 20 us dollars or 16  euros or 16 pounds  a special update is also on the way to  the xbox one version of the game  it will add a digital art gallery behind  the scenes commentary and a soundtrack  but there's no date on that update yet  developer studio mdhr is also still  working on the cuphead dlc the delicious  last course  it adds more levels and bosses plus miss  chalice as a new playable character  there's still no date on that and the  last we heard it was still planned for  2020  studio mdhr will have more to say in the  coming months  and just a reminder that we're still  raising money for charity with the  gamespot store  head over to store.gamespot.com to buy  cool play for all merch for yourself or  your friends including face masks  t-shirts hoodies and this awesome  skateboard  all proceeds go to charity until the end  of august so head to the store  get something cool and help us raise  money for a good cause  and that's your save save for tuesday  i'm chastity and you can find me on  twitter at chastity underscore v  and hey if you missed out on comic con  and you want to catch up on all the  latest on the boys  star trek rick and morty and more head  over to gamespot universe and i'll see  you next time  [Music]
 

